sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: LINE pairing and durable notification delivery
    accDescr: Personal profiles and family destinations are separate. Signed webhook events bind one-use codes, outboxes retry with leases and current-recipient checks.
    participant U as Signed-in dashboard
    participant S as Worker / LINE routes
    participant D as D1
    participant L as LINE platform
    participant J as Cron jobs
    U->>S: Request personal or owner-only family pairing code
    S->>D: Store code hash with session and 10-minute expiry
    S-->>U: Show one-use code
    Note over U,L: User sends code to bot in intended chat
    L->>S: POST /api/line/webhook with signature
    S->>S: Verify bounded raw body HMAC-SHA256
    S->>D: Dedup event, check live session, scope and role
    S->>D: Atomically consume code and bind destination
    S-->>L: Webhook response
    Note over S,D: Lifecycle events use ordering watermarks and reset guards
    S->>D: Telemetry or door event triggers cooldown and outbox
    J->>S: Daily family digest and orphan photo cleanup
    J->>S: Every-minute personal digest and outbox dispatch
    S->>D: Claim outbox lease and check current recipient
    S->>L: Push bilingual messages with stable retry key
    alt Delivery accepted
        S->>D: Complete matching lease
    else Transient delivery failure
        S->>D: Schedule bounded retry with backoff
    else Destination revoked or changed
        S->>D: Cancel stale delivery
    end
